DreamShaderToggleShowEphemeralMaterialsTooltip {
    at    Source/DreamShaderEditor/Private/Bridge/DreamShaderEditorBridge.cpp
    src   "Show Ephemeral ThinCustom/Instance-backend DreamShader materials in the Content Browser and asset pickers — needed when picking one as a material instance Parent or referencing it from a detail panel. Graph-backend materials are plain UMaterials with no Ephemeral state, so this toggle does not affect them. While shown, an explicit Save on one would materialize it to disk (the shadow warning and Make Ephemeral cover recovery)."
    text  "在 Content Browser 与资产选择器中显示临时态的 ThinCustom/Instance 后端 DreamShader 材质——选择材质实例父级或从细节面板引用它时需要。Graph 后端材质是普通 UMaterial，没有临时态，不受此开关影响。显示期间对其执行显式 Save 会将其物化到磁盘（遮蔽警告与 Make Ephemeral 负责补救）。"
    state machine
}

